{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-template-blog-js","path":"/blog/rune_art_deco/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"url":"https://poetry.me.uk"}},"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Style and beauty is in itself a call to authority, as style and beauty inherently has within itself proof of work.</p>\n<p>Many who promote Anglo-Saxon, Germanic and Nordic, ways, draw on old artifacts and art styles. The old ways are dead, and cannot come back, and even if they could come back, people born in this age would not want to live the old ways. No-one is pledging their life to their local Lord ... That time and age died, giving rise to an age where people pledged their lives to an archetypical idealised universal Lord ... That time, too, is dead ... Whatever is to be, is to be new, and fitting for this age.</p>\n<p>Art Deco and Rune art go well together.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/29007/rune_art_deco.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 100%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\" Rune Art Deco \"\n        title=\" Rune Art Deco \"\n        src=\"/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/5a190/rune_art_deco.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/772e8/rune_art_deco.png 200w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/e17e5/rune_art_deco.png 400w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/5a190/rune_art_deco.png 800w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/c1b63/rune_art_deco.png 1200w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/29007/rune_art_deco.png 1600w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>","excerpt":"Style and beauty is in itself a call to authority, as style and beauty inherently has within itself proof of work. Many who promote Anglo-Saxon, Germanic and Nordic, ways, draw on old artifacts and art styles. The old ways are dead, and cannot come…","rawMarkdownBody":"\nStyle and beauty is in itself a call to authority, as style and beauty inherently has within itself proof of work. \n\nMany who promote Anglo-Saxon, Germanic and Nordic, ways, draw on old artifacts and art styles. The old ways are dead, and cannot come back, and even if they could come back, people born in this age would not want to live the old ways. No-one is pledging their life to their local Lord ... That time and age died, giving rise to an age where people pledged their lives to an archetypical idealised universal Lord ... That time, too, is dead ... Whatever is to be, is to be new, and fitting for this age.\n\nArt Deco and Rune art go well together.\n\n![ Rune Art Deco ](./rune_art_deco.png)\n","fields":{"slug":"/blog/rune_art_deco/"},"frontmatter":{"date":"2026-10-10T00:00:00.000Z","displayDate":"October 10, 2026","title":"Rune Art Deco","tags":"pagan rune art deco","icon":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#e8d8d8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/e8b76/rune_art_deco.png","srcSet":"/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/30cdc/rune_art_deco.png 300w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/c7240/rune_art_deco.png 600w,\n/static/132d11e38efc0168ebc77eed41c3765d/e8b76/rune_art_deco.png 1200w","sizes":"(min-width: 1200px) 1200px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/132d11e38efc0168